    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Cilambo celeci caŵilanjidwaga soni kuti, cilambo ca Alefayimu, ligongo kala ŵandu ŵa mtundu welewo ŵatamaga mcilambo celeci. Aamoni ŵakolangaga jemanjaji kuti Asamusumimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵakwe ŵaliji ŵalewulewu, mpela ŵandu ŵa mtundu ŵa Aanaki. Ŵaliji ŵandu ŵajinji soni mtundu wamacili. Nambo AMBUJE ŵajonasile wosope ŵene, ni cilambo cawo cajigalidwe ni Aamoni, ŵiŵatamilicice mwelemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE ŵayitendele yindu ya mtundu uwowo yisukulu ya Esawu, yiyatamaga ku cilambo ca matumbi ga Edomu. AMBUJEWO ŵawujonasile mtundu wa Aholi, ni cilambo cawoco cajigalidwe ni ŵanace ŵa Esawu, soni ali ciŵela kutama kweleko mpaka lelo jino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵakutyocela ku cilumba ca Kilete, ŵatemi mcilambo ca mungulugulu Nyasa ja Mediteleniyani. Jemanjaji ŵawujonasile mtundu wosope wa ŵandu ŵiŵatamaga mcilambomo, ŵakolanjidwa kuti Afimu. Ŵacisumwile cilambo cosope kutandila kumpoto mpaka kuja kwika kum'mwela kwa msinda wa Gasa).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
